    1. The app requires camera access only to
    enable AR viewing.

    2. Location data is used solely to retrieve local weather
    for thematic exhibitions. You can choose either precise or approximate location
    accuracy based on your comfort level.

    3. Internet connection is used to
    fetch artworks from trusted museum APIs (V&A, Harvard Art Museums).'
